cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the WtE1000-Synthetic benchmark if you use this artifact."
title: "WtE1000-Synthetic: A Statistics-Matched Synthetic BOM Benchmark"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "WtE1000-Synthetic contributors"
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  A fully synthetic BOM/DAG, collaborator mapping, workload catalog and
  deterministic payload generator matching the published aggregate WtE1000
  statistics. The package does not contain confidential industrial data
  or reproduce the original engineering semantics or system runtimes.
